---
import { profile } from '../../data/profile';

const c = profile.contact;
const portfolioLabel = c.portfolio.replace(/^https?:\/\//, '');
const linkedinLabel = c.linkedin.replace(/^https?:\/\/(www\.)?/, '');

const wota = [
  'Led product planning and end-to-end UI/UX for a full website redesign (v3.0): 13 storefront modules and 735 shared components; ran UAT to close 30 issues, moving booking, membership purchase, and renewal to self-service.',
  'Owned UI design, product management, and QA for hotel booking inside LINE (LIFF mini-app): public launch in May 2026, full release in July with card-based membership purchase and English; about 238 Figma screens and design system v1.3.',
  'Turned Journey Rewards loyalty rules into PRD v2.2, 5 IA documents, and 4 linked prototypes: defined 18 redemption states, settled 28 upgrade rules, and caught 4 member benefits silently changed in a new proposal.',
  'Led four-language Figma i18n governance: synced 3,548 website strings into Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, English, and Japanese variables; personally reviewed 138 decisions, with zero mismatches.',
  'Initiated website behavior analysis, cross-checking session recordings, Mixpanel, and event definitions: found the login-wall bottleneck (9% of guests vs. 50% of members reach the booking form) and built a 41-item evidence-backed backlog with weekly automated tracking.',
  'Built a UI Spec tool with Claude Code in the existing Vue / Quasar codebase: 129 state screens viewable without login, five safeguards that keep it out of production, and 2 bugs affecting live members caught during verification.',
];

const fusion = [
  'Led a design team of up to 4, owning product UI systems, UX flows, sitemaps, wireframes, and interactive prototypes.',
  'Designed responsive web interfaces and partnered with engineers on interactive frontend pages and UX improvements.',
];

const skills = [
  ['Product', 'PRD · requirements · information architecture · user flows · edge cases · UAT · Jira'],
  ['Design', 'Figma · design systems · design tokens · prototyping · i18n · WCAG'],
  ['Frontend & AI', 'HTML / CSS · Vue / Quasar · Claude Code · ChatGPT · Codex'],
  ['Research & data', 'User interviews · usability testing · Mixpanel · Clarity · GTM'],
];
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
<title>Kenny Cheng · Product Designer Resume</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  :root { --ink: #0E2240; --ink-2: #3D4D66; --ink-3: #76849A; --line: #D9E0EA; --accent: #2F64A8; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body { margin: 0; background: #E9EDF2; }
  body { font-family: 'Inter', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; color: var(--ink); -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; print-color-adjust: exact; }
  .page { width: 210mm; height: 297mm; margin: 0 auto; background: #fff; padding: 13mm 15mm 11mm; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }
  @media screen { .page { margin: 24px auto; box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(14,34,64,.12); } }
  a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; gap: 10mm; padding-bottom: 4mm; border-bottom: 1.4pt solid var(--ink); }
  h1 { margin: 0; font-weight: 300; font-size: 24pt; letter-spacing: .01em; line-height: 1.15; }
  .role { margin-top: 1.6mm; font-size: 10.5pt; font-weight: 500; color: var(--accent); }
  .contact { text-align: right; font-size: 8.5pt; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--ink-2); white-space: nowrap; }
  .summary { margin: 3.4mm 0 0; font-size: 9.2pt; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--ink-2); }
  h2 { margin: 4.2mm 0 1.8mm; font-size: 8.6pt; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .14em; color: var(--accent); text-transform: uppercase; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 3mm; }
  h2::after { content: ""; flex: 1; height: .6pt; background: var(--line); }
  .job { margin-bottom: 2.4mm; }
  .job-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 4mm; }
  .job-head b { font-size: 10.2pt; font-weight: 600; }
  .job-head span.org { font-size: 9.2pt; color: var(--ink-2); margin-left: 2mm; }
  .job-head time { font-size: 8.5pt; color: var(--ink-3); white-space: nowrap; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  ul { margin: 1.1mm 0 0; padding-left: 4.2mm; }
  li { font-size: 8.7pt; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--ink-2); margin-bottom: .8mm; }
  li::marker { color: var(--accent); }
  .early { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto; gap: .9mm 3mm; font-size: 8.7pt; color: var(--ink-2); align-items: baseline; }
  .early b { font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); font-size: 9.1pt; }
  .early time { color: var(--ink-3); font-size: 8.5pt; white-space: nowrap; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bottom { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.55fr 1fr; gap: 8mm; }
  .skills { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; gap: 1mm 3mm; font-size: 8.7pt; line-height: 1.5; }
  .skills dt { font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); white-space: nowrap; }
  .skills dd { margin: 0; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .side p { margin: 0 0 1.3mm; font-size: 8.7pt; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .side p b { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }
  footer { margin-top: auto; padding-top: 3mm; border-top: .6pt solid var(--line); font-size: 8pt; color: var(--ink-3); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <header>
    <div>
      <h1>Kenny Cheng</h1>
      <div class="role">Product Designer | AI-Integrated Product Design</div>
    </div>
    <div class="contact">
      <div><a href={`mailto:${c.email}`}>{c.email}</a>{c.phoneIntl && <> · {c.phoneIntl}</>}</div>
      <div><a href={c.portfolio}>{portfolioLabel}</a></div>
      <div><a href={c.linkedin}>{linkedinLabel}</a></div>
      <div>New Taipei City, Taiwan · Open to remote or hybrid</div>
      <div>Also open to Taipei, Hsinchu, or Taoyuan</div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <p class="summary">Product designer with 8 years of experience and a foundation in brand and visual design. I combine product planning, UI/UX, and frontend implementation. At a luxury hotel booking platform, I own requirements, interface design, and delivery across the website, the LINE mini-app, and white-label sites. I use AI across research, specs, design, and frontend work, and keep direction and sign-off myself.</p>

  <h2>Experience</h2>
  <div class="job">
    <div class="job-head"><div><b>Product Designer</b><span class="org">Wota Lifestyle · luxury travel and hotel booking platform</span></div><time>Mar 2023 — Present</time></div>
    <ul>{wota.map((t) => <li>{t}</li>)}</ul>
  </div>
  <div class="job">
    <div class="job-head"><div><b>UI/UX Designer</b><span class="org">Fusion Next · IoT app and cloud platform, Taipei</span></div><time>Aug 2018 — Mar 2023</time></div>
    <ul>{fusion.map((t) => <li>{t}</li>)}</ul>
  </div>

  <h2>Brand and print foundation</h2>
  <div class="early">
    <b>Visual Design Director</b><span>Taichung Guangtian Temple · multimedia lead; brand visuals, web planning, project acceptance</span><time>Apr 2014 — Feb 2018</time>
    <b>Design Director</b><span>Daizhan (food retail) · team of 3–4; identity, packaging, catalogues, prepress</span><time>Oct 2010 — Dec 2013</time>
    <b>Graphic Designer</b><span>DIDIWORLD Company Ltd. (textiles) · print collateral, layout, print production</span><time>Sep 2009 — Sep 2010</time>
  </div>

  <div class="bottom">
    <div>
      <h2>Skills</h2>
      <dl class="skills">{skills.map(([k, v]) => <><dt>{k}</dt><dd>{v}</dd></>)}</dl>
    </div>
    <div class="side">
      <h2>Education and languages</h2>
      <p><b>Tunghai University</b> BFA, Fine Arts</p>
      <p><b>Languages</b> Mandarin (native) · Taiwanese<br>English (intermediate reading and writing)</p>
      <h2>Portfolio</h2>
      <p>4 case studies: cross-platform booking, member rewards, UI Spec tool, behavior analysis</p>
      <p><a href={c.portfolio}>{portfolioLabel}</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer><span>Kenny Cheng · Product Designer</span><span>Nov 2026</span></footer>
</div>
</body>
</html>
